Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.00,0:00:18.80,Default,,0,0,0,,The sun's setting? Already?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.88,0:00:20.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be. Guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.18,0:00:23.06,Default,,0,0,0,,He really was telling the truth!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.38,0:00:24.92,Default,,0,0,0,,The priest's new ability!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.10,0:00:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,He already had it back on the shuttle!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.10,0:00:29.87,Default,,0,0,0,,And now everything is\Nmoving at a faster speed!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.46,0:00:32.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything in this world is...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.20,0:00:34.26,Default,,0,0,0,,And I don't just mean the machines.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.34,0:00:36.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm talking literally everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.70,0:00:38.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh shit, the sun's already gone down.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.14,0:00:41.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Does that mean the\Ncompletion of his ability?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.92,0:00:45.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.18,0:00:47.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did that bastard go?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.42,0:00:51.40,Default,,0,0,0,,The longest I can stop time\Nis five seconds at most.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.48,0:00:53.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to locate him and strike him down.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.88,0:00:55.76,Default,,0,0,0,,All in the span of five seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.54,0:00:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the limit.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.86,0:00:59.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Now time will resume.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.28,0:01:01.11,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.34,0:01:02.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.58,0:01:04.11,Default,,0,0,0,,He's using it as a spring!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.18,0:01:27.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I will make this clear once and for all.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.54,0:01:29.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Time will keep racing by.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.06,0:01:32.65,Default,,0,0,0,,But for your clarification?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.16,0:01:36.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I did not obtain this ability just\Nso I could dispose of you all!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.62,0:01:39.21,Default,,0,0,0,,nor did I do it to\Nbecome the most powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.94,0:01:44.62,Default,,0,0,0,,The true purpose of this ability\Nis to guide the masses of humanity.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.70,0:01:46.47,Default,,0,0,0,,towards everlasting happiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.98,0:01:51.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Allow me to introduce you to my\Nnew stand, my gift to humanity.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.82,0:01:54.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall christen my stand...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.44,0:01:56.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Made in Heaven!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.22,0:02:21.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Itaami wo nori, Cairo tabi
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.62,0:02:25.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Kokoro wa eilu
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.84,0:02:30.86,Default,,0,0,0,,ni togisuma sareru
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.62,0:02:36.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Cairo Kai, Zero Chaka
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.54,0:02:39.76,Default,,0,0,0,,mei no sai hate de
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.24,0:03:00.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.64,0:03:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,,See.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.04,0:03:09.04,Default,,0,0,0,,you
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.68,0:03:10.51,Default,,0,0,0,,next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.82,0:03:34.88,Default,,0,0,0,,The reason for my disposing of you\Nall is for the future of humanity.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.32,0:03:37.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Your deaths here are nothing personal.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.44,0:03:42.82,Default,,0,0,0,,For the sake of all mankind's happiness,\Nyou shall become necessary sacrifices.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.82,0:03:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Ghost gun! Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.36,0:03:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It's no use, Emporio!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.98,0:03:52.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Bullets aren't gonna hit him!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.52,0:03:53.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Nuh-uh, Jolene!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.82,0:03:56.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I aim for the wall of\Nthe next building over!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.46,0:03:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,And I must put one of her\Nstickers on the bullet!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.10,0:04:01.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to that, there are two bullets now!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.58,0:04:04.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Emporio...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.26,0:04:06.78,Default,,0,0,0,,He's coming back around!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.44,0:04:08.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on tightly, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.12,0:04:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what happens, we\Ncan't let go of each other!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.84,0:04:28.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Crap, it's him!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.12,0:04:30.16,Default,,0,0,0,,He's chasing us!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.32,0:04:33.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Because smack is a stand, its\Nmovements aren't accelerated!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.92,0:04:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,But he's on our asses!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.58,0:04:36.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Emporio!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.88,0:04:40.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Put a sticker on another one of\Nyour bullets and shoot again!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.16,0:04:42.98,Default,,0,0,0,,We're gonna make our way to\Nthe wetlands just like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.06,0:04:44.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Head towards the ocean!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.50,0:04:49.32,Default,,0,0,0,,If we're surrounded by water, there's one\Nway we can kill this psycho time wizard!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.36,0:04:53.46,Default,,0,0,0,,The priest already caught up to us!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.64,0:04:55.99,Default,,0,0,0,,He's gonna wait for us at that building!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.38,0:04:59.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Use this next bullet to change\Nour trajectory, Emporio!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.64,0:05:00.66,Default,,0,0,0,,To the ocean!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.04,0:05:02.63,Default,,0,0,0,,That's where we need to be!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.82,0:05:07.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Focus on the marshes and aim the bullet\Nat the rocks jutting out of the water!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.26,0:05:16.54,Default,,0,0,0,,He's coming this way!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.70,0:05:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,,He's too fast! Listen,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.86,0:05:22.92,Default,,0,0,0,,even if the priest is able to pursue us\Nthrough this state of accelerated time,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.00,0:05:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,he only has one stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.04,0:05:28.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Also, I'm willing to bet that\Nits power is only above average.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.70,0:05:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,He has no other choice but to pick\Neach of us off, one at a time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.90,0:05:36.66,Default,,0,0,0,,That's when we have the\Nchance to beat him down.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.74,0:05:40.62,Default,,0,0,0,,At the exact moment when he tries\Nto come in and end my life, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.78,0:05:43.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Jotaro, that's when I'm\Ngoing to give you a signal.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.64,0:05:47.99,Default,,0,0,0,,When I do, stop time immediately and\Nkill that fucker before he gets away.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.56,0:05:49.62,Default,,0,0,0,,As for the timing,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.70,0:05:51.60,Default,,0,0,0,,you're going to want to\Nstop time at precisely
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.68,0:05:54.39,Default,,0,0,0,,the same instant that\Nhis attack hits my body.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.62,0:05:56.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.26,0:05:59.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't stop it any earlier than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.20,0:06:00.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Do it after.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.38,0:06:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,This is all going to happen quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.62,0:06:04.03,Default,,0,0,0,,The timing is important.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.16,0:06:06.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll have to grab him\Nwhile he's in mid-attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.82,0:06:09.53,Default,,0,0,0,,And to do that, your\NStar Platinum is the key.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.14,0:06:11.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo, wait a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.26,0:06:13.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You're doing what?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.02,0:06:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.56,0:06:17.15,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you trying to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.40,0:06:19.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Anastasia, that's a good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.90,0:06:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,But although Poochie said he'll end you\Nfirst, he might not act on his words.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.22,0:06:25.87,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't trust what he says.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.96,0:06:31.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Thinking about it a bit more\Nlogically, you'll end me first. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.02,0:06:35.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I get why you might think\Nthat, but it isn't accurate.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.26,0:06:38.80,Default,,0,0,0,,My Diver Drive is already in your\Nbody, protecting you like before.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.88,0:06:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,And it's not just you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.12,0:06:42.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene, Emporio, and Ermes too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.22,0:06:44.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You're all safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.52,0:06:47.16,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as you stay within\Nan arm's length of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.24,0:06:50.06,Default,,0,0,0,,So no matter who ends up\Ngetting attacked first,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.84,0:06:54.61,Default,,0,0,0,,the brunt of that first blow will\Nbe absorbed by my Diver Drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.78,0:06:57.90,Default,,0,0,0,,After that you'll feel\Na sensation through your
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.98,0:07:00.28,Default,,0,0,0,,body that's gonna be the\Nsignal from my stand!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.36,0:07:03.72,Default,,0,0,0,,That it's go time we\Nclear that's how it has to
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.80,0:07:06.98,Default,,0,0,0,,be time can't stop until\Nafter his attack lands!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.98,0:07:09.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Anastasia are you going for a draw?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.06,0:07:12.64,Default,,0,0,0,,What no way are you out of your mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.72,0:07:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,His next attack will definitely\Nkill you most likely but maybe
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.08,0:07:20.68,Default,,0,0,0,,before he strikes my vitals I can\Nmanage to send the signal off!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.76,0:07:24.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I have been having good luck\Nrecently, haven't I, Emporio?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.98,0:07:28.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Since I broke out of prison\NI've managed not to die somehow!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.46,0:07:31.30,Default,,0,0,0,,If I can just keep on\Nliving when this shitstorm
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.38,0:07:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,is over I'm finally gonna\Nask Jolene to marry me
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.12,0:07:39.12,Default,,0,0,0,,or something like that! You know?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.20,0:07:40.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.98,0:07:46.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.92,0:07:47.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Just propose.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.06,0:07:52.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not saying this because I'm\Nin despair over our situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.90,0:07:55.37,Default,,0,0,0,,There's still some hope left in your plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.04,0:07:57.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not dark at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.00,0:08:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,There might be only one path, but\Nif there's even a sliver of hope,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.84,0:08:04.96,Default,,0,0,0,,then that'll be the path to success.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.92,0:08:11.76,Default,,0,0,0,,He's over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.84,0:08:14.60,Default,,0,0,0,,He's already on the rock\Nahead of us! Emporio!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.96,0:08:21.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Everybody, gather up!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.52,0:08:22.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Get closer to me, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.54,0:08:26.37,Default,,0,0,0,,There!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.45,0:08:28.24,Default,,0,0,0,,He's coming around to the right!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.68,0:08:30.51,Default,,0,0,0,,He's here!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.16,0:08:32.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.38,0:08:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Due to the splashes,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.18,0:08:37.20,Default,,0,0,0,,being surrounded by water makes it\Neasier to see which way he's going.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.28,0:08:39.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Not yet, Mr. Jotaro.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.72,0:08:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever you do, don't stop time yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.08,0:08:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,If he gets away, it's all over.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.36,0:08:47.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Capturing him is the\Nonly way we can win this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.18,0:08:49.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got to sense the\Nsignal with your body.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.20,0:08:57.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait a second. Look up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.98,0:08:59.76,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with all the clouds?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.84,0:09:02.72,Default,,0,0,0,,They're racing by at insane\Nspeeds like a rocket.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.68,0:09:05.52,Default,,0,0,0,,and what the heck is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.66,0:09:07.92,Default,,0,0,0,,The sky to the east is getting brighter.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.00,0:09:08.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.06,0:09:12.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously, aren't they\Nmoving way too fast?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.64,0:09:15.06,Default,,0,0,0,,An hour was supposed to feel\Nlike two to three minutes,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.14,0:09:17.60,Default,,0,0,0,,which means it should have\Ntaken at least 20 to 30 minutes?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.68,0:09:19.21,Default,,0,0,0,,for the sun to rise again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.68,0:09:21.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't make sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.34,0:09:24.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The sun is coming up at\Nan impossibly high speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.24,0:09:31.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what the hell does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.28,0:09:34.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't that time is starting\Nto accelerate even more now?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.64,0:09:38.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Birds all over the world are still\Nflying at their natural speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.04,0:09:41.22,Default,,0,0,0,,So are butterflies and other insects.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.52,0:09:42.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Also,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.43,0:09:44.31,Default,,0,0,0,,there are no reported\Ncases of flowers or plants
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.40,0:09:47.40,Default,,0,0,0,,blooming abruptly or\Nwithering away at rapid rates.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.84,0:09:48.72,Default,,0,0,0,,See this glass?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.02,0:09:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm currently holding it in my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.20,0:09:55.85,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as it remains in my grasp, nothing\Nhappens even if I shake or swirl it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.00,0:09:59.10,Default,,0,0,0,,However, once I remove\Nmy grip from the glass...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.78,0:10:00.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You see?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.69,0:10:02.31,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't even see it fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.40,0:10:05.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It's already broken on the\Nfloor before you realize.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.66,0:10:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It the only possible explanation for this
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.22,0:10:10.94,Default,,0,0,0,,phenomenon is that time\Nis Accelerating everything
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.02,0:10:12.76,Default,,0,0,0,,in the world is\Nprogressively getting faster
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.84,0:10:14.88,Default,,0,0,0,,except for The movements\Nof living organisms.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.96,0:10:18.42,Default,,0,0,0,,This is all my assistance fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.50,0:10:20.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the Number one monthly manga artist.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.66,0:10:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah there's no way that I could have\Nonly Drawn one page in the entire night.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.34,0:10:26.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.02,0:10:29.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.70,0:10:33.48,Default,,0,0,0,,And for some reason, the ink on the pen\Ndries before it even touches the paper.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.56,0:10:35.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What am I supposed to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.26,0:10:40.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, what is it? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.24,0:10:42.95,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a manga artist\Nthat's still got it in?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.16,0:10:44.52,Default,,0,0,0,,And who could that be?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.66,0:10:46.37,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of person are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.06,0:10:48.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Rohan Kishibe.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.22,0:10:51.86,Default,,0,0,0,,The tide's going too fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.02,0:10:53.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't see the movement of the waves.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.80,0:10:55.88,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't read where the\Npriest is going like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.96,0:10:56.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.90,0:10:58.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is he going to come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.34,0:11:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone get ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.10,0:11:04.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Stone Ocean!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.30,0:11:06.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Smack!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.00,0:11:07.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.91,0:11:09.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Jotaro, not just yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.52,0:11:10.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We're almost there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.86,0:11:12.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait for the signal to come.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.76,0:11:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Do it now! Stop time!\NStop platinum! The world!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.30,0:11:28.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I got you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.04,0:11:30.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Take this, Father Pochi!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.82,0:11:37.65,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.96,0:11:40.49,Default,,0,0,0,,He used Jolene's stand\Nto attack Anastasia!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.02,0:11:42.64,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a step ahead of us!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.52,0:11:48.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Only four more seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.52,0:11:51.76,Default,,0,0,0,,If I'm not able to finish him off now,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.84,0:11:54.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll just hide within the\Naccelerating time again.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.04,0:11:57.57,Default,,0,0,0,,As soon as time resumes,\Nwe'll be done for!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.10,0:12:01.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to go at him with everything\NI've got while I still can!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.30,0:12:03.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Three more seconds!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.56,0:12:05.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Two seconds!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.22,0:12:24.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Knives!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.22,0:12:27.72,Default,,0,0,0,,While he was falling, the priest had\Nalready thrown them into the air,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.80,0:12:29.80,Default,,0,0,0,,just like how Dio did in the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.96,0:12:46.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my, it seems you\Nwere late by two steps.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.22,0:13:03.82,Default,,0,0,0,,The Joestar bloodline has to be expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.28,0:13:07.10,Default,,0,0,0,,They drew strength from\Ntheir pride and courage,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.20,0:13:09.68,Default,,0,0,0,,and came together to conquer their fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.34,0:13:14.02,Default,,0,0,0,,However, that connection through\Nblood is also their weakness.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.96,0:13:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Jotaro Kujo, your greatest\Nweakness is your daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.06,0:13:22.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Push. Push. Push. Push.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.26,0:13:29.26,Default,,0,0,0,,push
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.92,0:13:38.75,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hey,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.83,0:13:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,,old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.58,0:13:41.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.28,0:13:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I did steal a car.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.68,0:13:48.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I was leaving school.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.34,0:13:54.24,Default,,0,0,0,,In the supermarket parking\Nlot, there was a car.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.00,0:13:57.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did I do something like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.46,0:14:02.98,Default,,0,0,0,,But I know Dad's gonna come save me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.84,0:14:05.12,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.70,0:14:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Definitely.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.98,0:14:09.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad'll be here soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.50,0:14:12.06,Default,,0,0,0,,To save me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.94,0:14:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I must eliminate any obstacles\Nin the way of my destiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.20,0:14:36.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel no remorse for them or\Nyou, nor will I let you go free.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.08,0:14:38.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll put an end to everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.30,0:14:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,But to you, young Emporio, I'm the\None who killed your mother, aren't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.38,0:14:57.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Shoot me then, pull the trigger so you can\Nleave this godforsaken world as a martyr.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.92,0:15:03.27,Default,,0,0,0,,This is where your fate comes to an end!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.22,0:15:05.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Emporia!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.62,0:15:21.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene Kujo!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.38,0:15:33.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Showstar!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.78,0:15:38.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you truly think you can get away?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.94,0:15:40.64,Default,,0,0,0,,The speed at which you swim through water
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.72,0:15:43.25,Default,,0,0,0,,is slower than if you\Nwere running on land!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.54,0:15:51.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.80,0:15:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I caught a dolphin with Stone Ocean.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.46,0:15:56.62,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter how fast time is going,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.04,0:16:00.16,Default,,0,0,0,,every living creature is\Nmoving at its natural speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.24,0:16:02.36,Default,,0,0,0,,And then there's you, Father Poochy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.64,0:16:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,With your speed, you could probably\Ncatch up to this dolphin easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.66,0:16:08.37,Default,,0,0,0,,But distance is what matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.66,0:16:10.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You can reach us at close range.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.82,0:16:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,But how many meters can\Nyou keep on swimming for?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.26,0:16:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,500 meters?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.82,0:16:16.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe even 800?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.72,0:16:18.55,Default,,0,0,0,,A hundred?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.63,0:16:19.46,Default,,0,0,0,,How long can you last?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.58,0:16:22.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you swim longer distances than\Na dolphin without getting tired?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.90,0:16:25.06,Default,,0,0,0,,That has nothing to do\Nwith the flow of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.14,0:16:28.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It's still the same distance whether\Nyou're picking something up or swimming.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.38,0:16:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,That doesn't change. And plus,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.58,0:16:34.22,Default,,0,0,0,,it has to be at a distance where you\Ncan swim back to shore without drowning.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.30,0:16:36.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't ever let you get away.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.66,0:16:38.96,Default,,0,0,0,,This tiresome feud between us ends now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.56,0:16:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't have any trace of\Nyour existence in my future.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.30,0:16:44.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Chulene, climb the rope.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.90,0:16:46.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up and come to the dolphin!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.92,0:16:53.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Emporio, because of Anastasia's\Nsacrificing himself to protect my father,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.30,0:16:56.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm still alive, but\Nthat's the only reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.34,0:17:00.46,Default,,0,0,0,,And thanks to Ermes buying\Ntime attacking the priest,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.54,0:17:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I was able to extend my\Nrope to catch this dolphin.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.80,0:17:06.12,Default,,0,0,0,,When dolphins let people\Nride on their back,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.20,0:17:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard that they swim in a way\Nthat their rider won't ever drown.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.54,0:17:10.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry! Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.12,0:17:12.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Get over here already, Jolene!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.98,0:17:14.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Your rope is unraveling even more!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.46,0:17:18.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I know without a doubt\Nthat Dolphin is going
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.52,0:17:21.23,Default,,0,0,0,,to carry you somewhere\Nsafe and out of danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.68,0:17:23.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you saying? Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.88,0:17:25.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You can still make it over to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.02,0:17:28.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Emporium, I can't go with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.74,0:17:32.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Wherever I go, the Priest will sense the\Npresence of the Joestar blood within me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.62,0:17:35.42,Default,,0,0,0,,And no matter how far I\Nrun, I'll sense him too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.50,0:17:37.38,Default,,0,0,0,,He'll keep following me forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.56,0:17:42.27,Default,,0,0,0,,If I stay here, you won't\Nbe able to get away.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.32,0:17:46.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything will be okay, Emporio.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.24,0:17:49.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll be going the rest\Nof the way yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.80,0:17:50.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You can do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.46,0:17:53.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I have total faith in your capabilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.02,0:17:58.31,Default,,0,0,0,,The ones who died so that you could\Nlive are Anastasia, our friend Ermes,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.66,0:17:59.84,Default,,0,0,0,,and my father,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.30,0:18:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Jotaro Keicho.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.82,0:18:04.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep on living.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.16,0:18:06.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Your only hope!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.82,0:18:09.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what the heck\Nyou're even talking about!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.96,0:18:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,No! Please don't go!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.34,0:18:17.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Just wait! Hold on! Jolyne!\NStop! Don't leave me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.84,0:18:20.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry and pull yourself\Noff the rope already!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.08,0:18:24.52,Default,,0,0,0,,He's getting worn out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.02,0:18:27.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll hold him off for as long as I can!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.24,0:18:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring it, Father Poochie!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.66,0:18:38.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Stone Ocean!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.86,0:18:47.69,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.22,0:18:49.05,Default,,0,0,0,,July!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.88,0:18:53.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, hey, what's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.06,0:18:56.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that the sun rising? No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.44,0:18:58.44,Default,,0,0,0,,The sun's coming up again already?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.52,0:19:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't even look\Nlike a sphere anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.92,0:19:03.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It's more like a long belt of light!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.88,0:19:06.24,Default,,0,0,0,,The hands on my watch disappeared! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.54,0:19:09.92,Default,,0,0,0,,They're just going way too fast\Nfor me to see with the naked eye!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.00,0:19:11.84,Default,,0,0,0,,The day's over! It's over!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.92,0:19:12.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it's morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.16,0:19:14.10,Default,,0,0,0,,And night again!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.40,0:19:15.90,Default,,0,0,0,,This is crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.48,0:19:18.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Time is accelerating even more!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.62,0:19:21.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.53,0:19:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,This is really bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.80,0:19:23.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Get the canned food!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.24,0:19:26.88,Default,,0,0,0,,All the raw meat's gonna rot\Nand we can't eat it anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.96,0:19:27.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Buy it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.92,0:19:29.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Buy out all the canned food!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.78,0:19:31.43,Default,,0,0,0,,We're gonna run out of food!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.04,0:19:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at all this window dust collecting!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.22,0:19:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,The frame is rotting!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.12,0:19:53.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, my teeth!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.56,0:19:56.33,Default,,0,0,0,,The implants I just got\Nput in are falling out!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.70,0:19:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell, man?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.18,0:20:01.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What's with the sky?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.44,0:20:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Where the fuck did the sun go?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.24,0:20:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that strip of light in the\Nsky supposed to be the sun?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.00,0:20:07.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Is the time noon or is it night?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.20,0:20:09.42,Default,,0,0,0,,What day of the week is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.50,0:20:11.84,Default,,0,0,0,,And for that matter, what's even the year?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.92,0:20:13.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It's starting to get really cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.98,0:20:15.69,Default,,0,0,0,,The climate is changing, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.66,0:20:20.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.24,0:20:24.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The rocks are changing\Nshape because of the waves.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.08,0:20:26.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Is time ever going to stop speeding up?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.30,0:20:28.38,Default,,0,0,0,,How much more?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.66,0:20:31.48,Default,,0,0,0,,How much longer is this\Nnightmare going to last?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.40,0:20:48.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Now even the terrain is changing too!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.38,0:20:58.64,Default,,0,0,0,,What in the world is this? How bizarre!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.00,0:21:00.41,Default,,0,0,0,,It's only living things!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.70,0:21:10.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't breathe!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.30,0:21:40.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What in God's name are you doing\Nin here without any clothes on?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.54,0:21:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.82,0:21:42.98,Default,,0,0,0,,What the...? I...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.06,0:21:44.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up and stop stalling!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.78,0:21:47.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You and the prisoners need to get dressed!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.14,0:21:48.98,Default,,0,0,0,,But why am I naked too, though?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.26,0:21:50.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.34,0:21:53.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Time was going all fast, and then...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.32,0:21:54.26,Default,,0,0,0,,This ain't good!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.36,0:21:55.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm naked on camera!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.52,0:21:56.81,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll misunderstand!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.46,0:22:00.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.32,0:22:02.54,Default,,0,0,0,,This place is...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.10,0:22:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been here!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.50,0:22:06.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I know it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.36,0:22:11.26,Default,,0,0,0,,This place is Green Dolphin\NStreet State Prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.34,0:22:14.80,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm in the hallway in\Nfront of the visiting room.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.88,0:22:30.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Although you think I cope!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.76,0:22:35.06,Default,,0,0,0,,My head is filled with hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.56,0:22:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Of some place.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.20,0:22:43.80,Default,,0,0,0,,other than here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.52,0:22:50.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Although you think I smile!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.74,0:22:55.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Inside and all the while
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.06,0:23:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm wondering about my destiny?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.00,0:23:07.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm thinking
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.00,0:23:13.60,Default,,0,0,0,,about all the
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.68,0:23:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,things I'd like
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.58,0:23:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,to do in my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.98,0:23:29.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a dreamer.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.36,0:23:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,A distant dreamer.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.38,0:23:39.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Dreaming far away.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.78,0:23:44.58,Default,,0,0,0,,From today!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.50,0:23:55.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.50,0:24:25.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
